Comment:
 The logo library is deliberately not under a single license.  The logos
 drawn for ggg and for the jjba23 projects are MIT, the project's own
 license; most of the tech logos come from Simple Icons under CC0-1.0, and a
 handful record another free license (Apache-2.0, MIT, GPL-2.0-only,
 GPL-2.0-or-later, GPL-3.0-or-later or the Unlicense).  CREDITS.org names
 each file with its origin and license and is installed with this package.
